      <div class="bar-column"><span class="bar-value">5,114</span><div class="bar" style="--bar-height: 6.2%"></div><strong>2025</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <b>Figure 2.</b> Recorded incidents of paddy-residue burning in Punjab. Recorded fire incidents are not equivalent to the tonnage of straw burned and may not capture every partial or delayed-burning event.
    Source: CEEW reporting and government satellite-monitoring records, 2020–2024; 2025 value provisional.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

